{"id":"2c647d697d7f768c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-dimension-machines.md","title":"Schnorr 双维数的机器复杂度刻画","display":"thm-schnorr-dimension-machines — Schnorr 双维数的机器复杂度刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-dimension-machines","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-dimension-machines"],"display":"thm-schnorr-dimension-machines — Schnorr 双维数的机器复杂度刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]","[[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorems 17.10.1–17.10.2","source_printed_pages":"539–540","source_pdf_pages":"559–560","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-dimension-machines"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-dimension-machines</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-dimension-machines — Schnorr 双维数的机器复杂度刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cfc6a383edf25e5\" href=\"?note=6cfc6a383edf25e5\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-dimensions\">43-df-schnorr-dimensions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorems 17.10.1–17.10.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"539–540"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"559–560"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SH},\\dim_{SP}\">\\(\\dim_{SH},\\dim_{SP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cfc6a383edf25e5\" href=\"?note=6cfc6a383edf25e5\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-dimensions\">43-df-schnorr-dimensions</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}\">\\(\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_M\">\\(K_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a>。所量化机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；上下极限在扩展非负实数中理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SH}(X)=\\inf_{M:\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)}\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\ n&gt;0}\\frac{K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)}n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_{SH}(X)=\\inf_{M:\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)}\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\ n&gt;0}\\frac{K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)}n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SP}(X)=\\inf_{M:\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)}\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\ n&gt;0}\\frac{K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)}n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_{SP}(X)=\\inf_{M:\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)}\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\ n&gt;0}\\frac{K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)}n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取下确界的机器域停机概率必须可计算；将其换成所有前缀自由机器会得到另一种维数。各机器未描述的串允许复杂度为无穷，最终下确界由存在合适完整描述机器保证有限。源文证明中下标和不等号有排版问题，本项只登记两个明确的定理陈述。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorems 17.10.1–17.10.2，印刷页 539–540，PDF 页 559–560。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorr-dimensions","status":"resolved","id":"6cfc6a383edf25e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-dimensions","status":"resolved","id":"6cfc6a383edf25e5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\dim_{SH},\\dim_{SP}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]；$\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}$、$K_M$ 见 [[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]。所量化机器 $M:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$；上下极限在扩展非负实数中理解。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\dim_{SH},\\dim_{SP}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]；$\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}$、$K_M$ 见 [[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]。所量化机器 $M:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$；上下极限在扩展非负实数中理解。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim_{SH},\\dim_{SP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}","display":false},{"tex":"K_M","display":false},{"tex":"M:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim_{SH}(X)=\\inf_{M:\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)}\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\ n>0}\\frac{K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)}n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\dim_{SP}(X)=\\inf_{M:\\operatorname{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)}\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\ n>0}\\frac{K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)}n.","display":true}],"bytes":1899,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-dimension-machines]] — Schnorr 双维数的机器复杂度刻画"}],"outgoing":["6cfc6a383edf25e5","16634b9fc07ef245"]}